      "kicker": "Name it after you see it",
      "heading": "Sweep-like behavior.",
      "body": "Notice the order: we described what price did <em>before</em> we gave it a name.<br><br><strong>Sweep-like behavior:</strong> price trades through an area where orders may rest (above a high or below a low), then fails to sustain beyond it.<br><br>That’s a description. Not a prediction."
    },
